    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待って、ここからだと
外出ちゃうよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait. Won't we
end up outside if
we go this way?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだけど、
他に行くとこねーぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, but
where else are we
supposed to go?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>足りない……
足りないな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Not enough...
That's not enough...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんだよ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What the hell!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今すぐ、ここから
出ていけ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Leave this place
at once...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>足りないって何のこと！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do you mean,
"not enough"!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あレ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Oh, uh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>き、気味悪ぃよな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-This's pretty creepy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>302996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>足りないって
何が足りないんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, "not enough"?
What do we not
have enough of?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっき貝殻、拾ったでしょ？
あれのことじゃない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Didn't you pick up some
seashells earlier? They
probably mean those, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それが足りないから
出てけってことなのかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, what, we gotta leave
'cause we don't have
enough seashells?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから、&lt;Couleur&gt;のお兄さんも
やっぱりそこから
出てっちゃったのかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anyway, &lt;Couleur&gt;'s brother
probably left that way
too, don't you think?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だろ、たぶん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, probably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もし、そうだとしても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, even if so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>外に出たなら、
見つからないよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If they went outside, I'm not
so sure we'll ever find them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>残念だけど、諦めよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I'm not too happy
about it, but maybe we
should just give up?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>旅が終わったら、
一緒に探したげるよ、ね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And once our journey's
over, we'll all search
again together, okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前にここ来た時、
あんな出口あったっけ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Was there an exit
over there the last
time we came here?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>前来た時はあっちの
出口から外出たんだよ。
行く場所なくてさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Last time we came, we left through
the exit over that way. 'Cause
there was nowhere else to go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だよね……
でも、なんで……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's right...
So then, why...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり貝殻だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It has to be
those seashells.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>303864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>貝殻？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seashells?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、貝殻、
たくさん集まったシ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, look, at how many
of them we've gathered, now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから、先に進めるように
なったんじゃないかな。
ほら、通行料みたいな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So now that we have this many,
we can go further in. Probably. It's
kind of like paying at a toll road.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>通行料？　貝殻が
お金って……こと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Toll road? So, these
seashells are...money...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、昔の人は
みんな貝殻をお金に
してたっていうかラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. Actually, I've heard that,
a long time ago, everyone
used seashells as money.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもいいさ、
先に進めるように
なったんだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, anyway, we
can go further in
now, can't we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Couleur&gt;の姉ちゃんも
この先にいるかも
しれないんだしさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And &lt;Couleur&gt;'s sister
might be further
ahead, too, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、行くぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お兄さんだってば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's her brother...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>聞こえてないよ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think he
can hear you...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
